  "messages": [
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 0,
      "offsetInSection": 220,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00000000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 2,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Il y a tant de Pokémon qui vivent à Illumis aux\ncôtés des êtres humains ! C’est merveilleux !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 1,
      "offsetInSection": 232,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 98
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est justement pour ça que j’ai choisi\nde visiter Illumis. J’adore cette harmonie !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 2,
      "offsetInSection": 428,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 89
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais elle ne vaut rien comparée à l’harmonie\nque j’ai avec mes Pokémon.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 3,
      "offsetInSection": 608,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 76
    },
    {
      "displayText": "J’ai rencontré mes deux amours alors qu’ils\nn’étaient qu’un Mélo et un Laporeille !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 4,
      "offsetInSection": 760,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "À force de passer du temps tous ensemble,\nils ont fini par évoluer en Mélofée et Lockpin !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 5,
      "offsetInSection": 936,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 95
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Ces Pokémon en particulier n’évoluent que quand\nils se sentent assez proches de leur Dresseuse.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 6,
      "offsetInSection": 1128,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 100
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, j’ai une idée ! Et si on faisait un combat ? Ça\nnous rapprocherait encore plus de nos Pokémon !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 7,
      "offsetInSection": 1328,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Reviens me voir si tu as envie de faire\nun petit combat !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 8,
      "offsetInSection": 1536,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00520065007600690065006E00730020006D006500200076006F0069007200200073006900200074007500200061007300200065006E007600690065002000640065002000660061006900720065000A0075006E00200070006500740069007400200063006F006D0062006100740020002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 62
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿\t",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 9,
      "offsetInSection": 1660,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00090000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Allez, bats-toi contre nous ! Mélofée et Lockpin\nveulent te montrer à quel point on s’entend bien !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 10,
      "offsetInSection": 1672,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 104
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Battons-nous, alors !",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 11,
      "offsetInSection": 1880,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0042006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F00750073002C00200061006C006F00720073002000210000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Non, merci.",
      "escapedControlUnits": 0,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 12,
      "offsetInSection": 1924,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004E006F006E002C0020006D0065007200630069002E0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 12
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Dommage...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 13,
      "offsetInSection": 1948,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0044006F006D006D006100670065002E002E002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Super ! Allez les amis, battons-nous !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 14,
      "offsetInSection": 1980,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "005300750070006500720020002100200041006C006C0065007A0020006C0065007300200061006D00690073002C00200062006100740074006F006E0073002D006E006F007500730020002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 43
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+000F>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 15,
      "offsetInSection": 2068,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF000F0000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Oh, on a perdu...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 16,
      "offsetInSection": 2080,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F0068002C0020006F006E00200061002000700065007200640075002E002E002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 22
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Tu t’entends merveilleusement bien avec\ntes Pokémon, en tout cas. C’est beau à voir !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 17,
      "offsetInSection": 2124,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 90
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mais je ne crois pas que votre amitié soit aussi\nprofonde que la nôtre !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 18,
      "offsetInSection": 2304,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 77
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quoique...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 19,
      "offsetInSection": 2460,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00510075006F0069007100750065002E002E002E00100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 15
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Mes pauvres Pokémon chéris n’ont probablement\npas apprécié le goût de la défaite...<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 20,
      "offsetInSection": 2492,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 88
    },
    {
      "displayText": "On va aller se remonter le moral dans un café !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 21,
      "offsetInSection": 2668,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "004F006E00200076006100200061006C006C00650072002000730065002000720065006D006F006E0074006500720020006C00650020006D006F00720061006C002000640061006E007300200075006E002000630061006600E90020002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 52
    },
    {
      "displayText": "D’ailleurs, je te recommande de passer du temps\navec tes Pokémon dans des cafés, toi aussi.<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 22,
      "offsetInSection": 2772,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 96
    },
    {
      "displayText": "C’est un excellent moyen de tisser des liens\nforts avec eux !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 23,
      "offsetInSection": 2964,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "0043201900650073007400200075006E00200065007800630065006C006C0065006E00740020006D006F00790065006E002000640065002000740069007300730065007200200064006500730020006C00690065006E0073000A0066006F0072007400730020006100760065006300200065007500780020002100100002011401390000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 66
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Et comme tu le sais déjà, une équipe forte,\nc’est d’abord une équipe soudée !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 4,
      "index": 24,
      "offsetInSection": 3096,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 82
    },
    {
      "displayText": "<U+0010><U+0002>뷿<U+0019>",
      "escapedControlUnits": 3,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 25,
      "offsetInSection": 3260,
      "rawDecodedUtf16Hex": "00100002BDFF00190000",
      "trailingZeroPaddingUnits": 1,
      "utf16Units": 5
    },
    {
      "displayText": "Quand il s’agit de passer du bon temps entre\namis au café, on est imbattables !<U+0010><U+0002>ĔĹ",
      "escapedControlUnits": 2,
      "flagsUpper16": 0,
      "index": 26,
